%% Trace context across a queue: POST /submissions -> arq -> worker.
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API (ASGI middleware)
    participant R as Redis (arq)
    participant W as arq worker
    C->>A: POST /api/v1/submissions
    Note over A: span http.request (root, head-sampled)
    A->>A: span postgres.query
    A->>A: span arq.enqueue (queue, producer)
    A->>R: enqueue_job(fn, **kwargs + _ozymandias={trace_id, parent_id=enqueue span, sampling_priority})
    A-->>C: 202
    Note over A: root finishes -> chunk flushed to the agent
    R->>W: job (after queue wait)
    Note over W: traced() pops _ozymandias, extract() -> child of arq.enqueue
    W->>W: span arq.job (worker, consumer), queue.wait_ms from enqueue_time
    W->>W: span judge.container.run, span postgres.query
    Note over W: arq.job finishes -> its own chunk, same trace_id
